    /// THE ANVIL'S OWN OFFLINE OPEN (javap 26.2 AnvilBlock
    /// useWithoutItem the openMenu walk the door speaks + AnvilMenu
    /// ctor the disasm banks — scripts/jar_work/anvil_menu_202.txt the
